{"title":"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/f/d4f3091ba7091f89d164bbdf4c5d334567348260.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x^3+6x^2+12x+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"208\" height=\"19\" />, solve the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/9/3e94462ad75f6c4509aaa066452584e7d8918d42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(f(x))) = 0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/1/001718d442c27ad1d0916bb7291112fff3dd112a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=(x+2)^3-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"153\" height=\"19\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfb94002a8a30bee511b85a24695de652cf86967.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(f(x)))=(x+2)^{27}-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"210\" height=\"19\" />. Setting this equal to zero and solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ffc0587e2986b1e81d58987aabba87b958b7dc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x=-2+\\sqrt[27]{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"122\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2014 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide